{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Biph1vNhzE1792754089.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>蘭桂坊同附近街道首階段美化工程完成，晚上7點鐘舉行光影藝術表演。</p><p></p><p>光影藝術表演首個主題為萬聖節，以德己立街石牆及附近路面為舞台，結合創新的投影技術與燈光效果，營造空間與視覺的互動效果。畫面可以看見，投影出不同顏色萬聖節南瓜的圖案。</p><p></p><p>表演逢周五至日同公眾假期，晚上7時至凌晨2時上演，每節約3分鐘，每10分鐘播放一次。主題會因應不同節慶而更換，營造不同氣氛。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.640473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:21.069835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:24.359990+00:00","content_hash":"bcd40f36f0c1d0b6db25f5195a978b7e9530a0fb5ffb3c01efe04acbf097a235","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.640473+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}